<p>Chandapura sits on Hosur Road at the point where the Anekal and Dommasandra roads branch off, about 10 km beyond Electronic City. It grew as an affordable, plotted area for people working in Electronic City and the Bommasandra industrial belt, and it now has a mix you rarely find closer to the city: gated apartments, villa communities, independent houses and whole buildings of rental floors. That mix changes what you need from an interior designer. This guide applies our <a href="/interior-designers-bangalore/">Bangalore designer guide</a> to Chandapura homes.</p>

<h2>Chandapura homes and what they need</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Home type</th><th>Where you find it</th><th>Typical interior brief</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Gated apartments, 2 and 3 BHK</td><td>Along Hosur Road and Chandapura–Anekal Road</td><td>Kitchen, wardrobes, TV unit and ceiling before moving in</td></tr>
    <tr><td>KHB and plotted layouts</td><td>Surya City (Suryanagar), Heelalige side</td><td>Full house interiors, pooja room, staircase storage</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Villas and row houses</td><td>Gated villa communities off Anekal and Dommasandra roads</td><td>Premium kitchen, walk-in wardrobes, double-height living room</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Rental floors (1 and 2 BHK)</td><td>Thirumagondanahalli, Neralur, around the industrial areas</td><td>Durable kitchens and wardrobes repeated across floors, on a budget</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Because so many homes here are independent houses, briefs are often bigger than in an apartment: a kitchen on each floor, a pooja room on the ground floor, storage under the staircase and wardrobes in four or five bedrooms. Plan them together, with one specification, so that the whole house is built and priced consistently.</p>

<h2>What interiors cost in Chandapura in 2026</h2>
<p>Rates here follow the Bangalore numbers in our <a href="/cost/">cost guide</a>. Local factories save on transport, and a firm that does not need a showroom in the city has lower overheads, so quotes for the same specification can be a few per cent lower than in central Bangalore.</p>
