<h2>A shortlist plan for Chandapura</h2>
<ol class="steps">
  <li><strong>Write the brief</strong>Room by room, with storage needs, the number of kitchens and which floors are for rent.</li>
  <li><strong>Pick two or three firms that manufacture locally</strong>Ask each for a finished home in Chandapura or Electronic City you can visit.</li>
  <li><strong>Visit the factories</strong>Look for a panel saw, an edge-bander and stacked, branded boards stored off the floor.</li>
  <li><strong>Compare itemised quotes</strong>Same scope, same board and finish, GST shown separately. Use the <a href="/calculators/home-interior-quote/">quote builder</a> to sanity-check totals.</li>
  <li><strong>Sign with milestones</strong>Design, production, installation and handover, with the delivery date and warranty in writing.</li>
</ol>
